        ["Binary-search the boundary: a feasible midpoint keeps the left half including mid; an infeasible midpoint discards mid and everything below it.", "Scan capacities from 1 until feasible becomes true.", "Binary-search while moving right whenever the midpoint is feasible.", "Evaluate feasible only at 1 and M, then average the endpoints."],
