        ["Take max(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1]): skip one of the two final characters.", "Set dp[i][j] to zero, restarting a contiguous match.", "Always take dp[i - 1][j - 1] + 1.", "Add dp[i - 1][j] and dp[i][j - 1]."],
